{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:778a4fb7b9ea6c935c2d8a111ef3291f0533e4df82c08e125706e25617afd016",
      "text": "我是从今天开始在Cafe Parade兼职的\n水岛咲！请啪噼地多多关照☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e447bbe63af7508d28421c397807a59a9dd2ad6687ccdbcc8121656962021ab",
      "text": "我们才要请你多关照呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6180d259e4b1cb19076f0ea5e464813d634919b9582df46a90a69882799b2950",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢你准备了这么啪噼可爱的制服。能穿着\n这样的衣服工作，我超级开心的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9fe7fa58c48dfc4cfb78261fe433a00dbbea8ade49f4f31043217fa5c114b74",
      "text": "（啪噼……？是异国的语言吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aeda2c0b730f464250db92f1e49fc967e3b8388a9ecca351e1c1acc1b4fa6d0",
      "text": "（又来了一个古怪的人呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef5641a8e291d6cf89ba3dd9eef3f382bea0d19719318ec4d5fd436e09db468c",
      "text": "对了！今天有想送给大家的东西哦。\n当当——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef4eb18fe50618eae6684a3264fb2dafa131c3575fbb64aea12631db94cfbcd8",
      "text": "唔，这是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed9b68cc162adaa23dc8c78f3a5d0a074004e3d8c9f2ba4dae77359e5cb90334",
      "text": "我想着能不能帮上什么忙，就和卷卷一起\n买了蛋糕回来！这就是所谓的刺探敌情？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b4d8fa868e2e547bd56f0ced2eceb4b065f07f8beaa07fb165a30cd1386faae",
      "text": "是最近在我学校附近新开的店里的哦。\n有很多新奇口味的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d11bb3090960a55cac458846d78202632e4ebb918c0b72ff170d2a78a3b8b680",
      "text": "嚯，那还挺耐人寻味的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9397201b5b0cbcd4bffae8498704719a2beeb750a00db4b23c7691fb16cb81fb",
      "text": "对吧对吧！\n蛋糕的夹层里放了红豆馅……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ae387aad286cec36d958d65ebd414972dbf848c86f8514f5079e18d59714d7e",
      "text": "庄一郎，你怎么了？\n脸色好苍白啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_g:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6caeb7ff9a66183e32d78d0a1583023f21a73915c27c3a2b41da888d6c9f36e7",
      "text": "不好意思，稍微有点……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
